	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. et pacem in... (domino) suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Istis <persName ref="p1049">Farelli</persName> nostri literis, mi pater, meas eram <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>bene longas adiuncturus, quas superiore <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>hebdomade tibi et d. <persName ref="p8111">Martyri</persName> communes scripsi; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sed commode heri evenit, ut mihi tuae <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>illae redderentur, quas ad d. <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName> die <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>superioris mensis 13 scripsisti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quoniam igitur <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>illae multo plenius rem omnem tractant, de qua <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ad vos scripseram, nec mihi licuit responsum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>tam subito parare, coactus sum differre, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod iam pridem factum esse vellem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Novi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>enim Satanae astutias.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Sed tamen de te et <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nostris istic omnibus optima quaeque mihi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>polliceor, quibus nimirum melius, ut spero, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>simus noti, quam ut nefandum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quicquam de nobis suspicemini.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Me quidem spero <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ita vobis satisfacturum, ut omnem vobis <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>scrupulum eximam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Interim vide, mi pater, ut <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>me ames; nam certe nulla unquam restanta <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>interveniet, quae meam in te totamque <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>vestram ecclesiam observantiam abrumpat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Iam ante familiariter ad te scripsi de <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quatuor Bibliorum exemplaribus ad d. <persName ref="p7228">Zwinglium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>missis; eorum pretium quoniam a me petiit <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p8102">Robertus Stephanus</persName>; rogo, ut, nisi tibi molestum <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>erit, moneas eam pecuniam tuto isti committi <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>posse, qui has tibi literas reddit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Cupio et <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>illud d. <persName ref="p1283">Gesnero</persName> significari habere me <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>iampridem aliquot Athenagora ad illum <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>perferenda exemplaria, sed non invenire, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cui tuto committam; nam occasio Zursacensium <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>nundinarum aegrotanti mihi est elapsa.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Vide, m<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>i pater, quam familiariter haec a te petam, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>et hinc saltem coniice eum esse me ac futurum, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>qui adhuc fui, eum videlicet, qui et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>tua caussa velim omnia et omnia vicissim a te <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>expectem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Bene vale, mi pater, cum <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>omnibus tuis collegis ac symmystis, quos sane <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>cupio ex me quam officiosissime salutari.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>D. Iesus magis ac magis vobis benedicat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l280">Lausannae</placeName> quarta septembris<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/><persName ref="p8033">Th(eodorus) Beza</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>tibi in domino <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>addictissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Eximio Christi servo <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae vere <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>fido pastori.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
